[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  - The full Manifest debug suite (55 tests) passed after the code changes. After that I added the new tests and changed\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcomments, \u001b[17Gd re-ran only th\u001b[35Gprocurement suite, which passes (28 cases, 7 of\u001b[85Gem\u001b[88Gnew). clang-tidy i\u001b[107G clean\u001b[114Gon th\u001b[120G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[7Gur changed files, and the format check passes.\u001b[54G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI b\u001b[9Goke th\u001b[16G \"next step this\u001b[33Gsystem\u001b[40Gmust run\" calculation\u001b[62Gon\u001b[65Gpurpose\u001b[73Gto\u001b[76Gsee\u001b[80Gwhether\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gnew\u001b[96Gfast-forward\u001b[109Gtest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnotices. At\u001b[17Gfirs\u001b[23Gi\u001b[25G didn't: in AI-r\u001b[42Gn regions the delivery\u001b[65Gclose lands on\u001b[80Ga day boundary,\u001b[96Gwhere the sys\u001b[111Gm runs\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Banyway. I moved \u001b[22Gha\u001b[26Gtest \u001b[32Go\u001b[34Ga player-run te\u001b[50Gder whose closes fall off those\u001b[82Gboundaries, and now\u001b[102Git catch\u001b[111Gs\u001b[113Gthe\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbreak.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI didn't\u001b[14Grun\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gfull\u001b[27Ggate:\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gplan\u001b[42Gcalls\u001b[48Gfor\u001b[52Git\u001b[55Gafter\u001b[61Gslices\u001b[68G3\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74G6\u001b[76Gonly.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BNo pi\u001b[11Gned hash moved.\u001b[27GThe pinn\u001b[36Gd worlds do\u001b[48Gh\u001b[50Gld \u001b[54Genders, but none has a delivered\u001b[87Gtote,\u001b[93Gso\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gnew\u001b[104Gcounter,\u001b[113Gleft\u001b[118Gat\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gzero, doesn't seem to\u001b[27Gc\u001b[29Gange the\u001b[38Gsave'\u001b[45Gbytes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWorth knowing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The procurement\u001b[21Gsuite\u001b[27Gnow\u001b[31Gtakes\u001b[37Gabout\u001b[43G20\u001b[46