[0.138, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gmarket reports\u001b[20Gand adds\u001b[29Gthe trip's charges and a profi\u001b[60G. It bids\u001b[70Gonly within the tender's budget and only\u001b[111Gif the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bc\u001b[7Gmpany can pay\u001b[21Gfor\u001b[25Gth\u001b[28G goods and the bond. Among the \u001b[60Genders i\u001b[69G can bid\u001b[78Gon, it\u001b[85Gpicks the \u001b[96Gne with\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gmost budget\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleft over.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe profit:\u001b[17G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[21Gj\u001b[23Gb's target profi\u001b[40G, or one\u001b[49Gcredit more than the\u001b[70Gbest ordi\u001b[80Gary trade i\u001b[92G could\u001b[99Gmake, whichever is\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhigher. This\u001b[18Gwas\u001b[22Gmy\u001b[25Greading\u001b[33Gof\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gplan's\u001b[47G\"above\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gbest\u001b[63Gtrade's\u001b[71Gestimate\".\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAfter the bid:\u001b[22m the job waits\u001b[34Gin a new \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBidding\u001b[39m phase until the bid close. If it\u001b[84Gwins,\u001b[93Gbuys wh\u001b[101Gt's\u001b[105Gst\u001b[108Gll owed at\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe source, carries\u001b[25Git to the tender's venue and\u001b[54Gdeliv\u001b[60Grs\u001b[63Git, making more trips\u001b[85Gwhile\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gdelivery\u001b[104Gwindow\u001b[111Gallows.\u001b[119GIf\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Git loses, it goes back\u001b[28Gto choosing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhen a contract ends early:\u001b[22m a\u001b[35Gd\u001b[37Gfault,\u001b[44Gor totes left over\u001b[63Gafter the last del\u001b[82Gvery, turn the cargo into an\u001b[111Gordinary\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btrade lot\u001b[15Gto\u001b[18Gsell.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSaves:\u001b[22m a load refuses a bidding job \u001b[42Ghat names no tender.\u001b[63G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBuild order:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mthe policy\u001b[29Gmodule\u