[1.020, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcompany can pay for the\u001b[29Gg\u001b[31Gods a\u001b[37Gd th\u001b[42G bond. Among th\u001b[58G tenders\u001b[67Git \u001b[71Gan bid on,\u001b[82Git picks th\u001b[94G \u001b[96Gn\u001b[99Gwith the most budget\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleft\u001b[10Gover.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mThe profit:\u001b[17G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[21Gjob's\u001b[27Gtarget\u001b[34Gprofit,\u001b[42Gor\u001b[45Gone\u001b[49Gcredit\u001b[56Gmore\u001b[61Gthan\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gbest\u001b[75Gordinary\u001b[84Gtrade\u001b[90Git\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gmake,\u001b[105Gwhichever\u001b[115Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ghigher. This was my re\u001b[28Gd\u001b[30Gng\u001b[33Gof the plan's\u001b[47G\"above the best trade's\u001b[71Gestimate\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAfter the bid:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mthe job\u001b[28Gwait\u001b[34Gin a new \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBidding\u001b[51G\u001b[39mpha\u001b[55Ge\u001b[57Guntil the bid clos\u001b[76G. If it wins, it buy\u001b[99Ghat's still owed\u001b[116Gat\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe source, carri\u001b[23Gs it\u001b[28Gto th\u001b[34G tender's v\u001b[46Gnue and delivers\u001b[63Git, making more t\u001b[81Gips while the d\u001b[97Glivery window\u001b[111Gallows. If\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Git loses, it \u001b[19Goes back to choosing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhen a contract ends early:\u001b[33G\u001b[22ma\u001b[35Gdefault,\u001b[44Gor\u001b[47Gtotes\u001b[53Gleft\u001b[58Gover\u001b[63Gafter\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Glast\u001b[78Gdelivery,\u001b[88Gturn\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gcargo\u001b[103Ginto\u001b[108Gan\u001b[111Gordinary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  trade lot to sell.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSaves:\u001b[22m a\u001b[14Gload refuses a\u001b[29Gbidding job\u001b[42Gh\u001b[44Gt \u001b[47Games no tender.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBuild order:\u001b[22m the policy module now dep\u001b[44Gnds\u001b[48Gon procurement, so procure