contract is under way drops the contract,\u001b[71Gwhich\u001b[77Gthen\u001b[82Gdefaults.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BIn an earlier prob\u001b[24G, the NPC defaulted on a\u001b[50Gin\u001b[53Gcontract while another trader was\u001b[87Gbuying tin at the\u001b[105Gsame source.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThat kind of competition could disrupt\u001b[44Gslice\u001b[50G6's\u001b[54Ggovernance\u001b[65Gfixture.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BSlice 6 is next: the\u001b[24Ggovernance\u001b[35Gfixture,\u001b[44GW12's\u001b[50Gclose-out,\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Ggate\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gstage\u001b[84Gcross-review.\u001b[98GIt\u001b[101Gneeds\u001b[107Gthis\u001b[112Gsession's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcont\u001b[8Gxt, so \u001b[16Gontinue he\u001b[27Ge; \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m fi\u001b[42Gst\u001b[45Gw\u001b[47Guld\u001b[51Galso work.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 19m 35s · done 6:39 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
