[0.293, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat it does\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTurning it on:\u001b[22m a ship's policy has a\u001b[42Gnew\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcontracts\u001b[56G\u001b[39mswitch,\u001b[64Gset\u001b[68Gwith\u001b[73G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest.Policy.Set\u001b[39m.\u001b[94GNPC\u001b[98Gtraders\u001b[106Gget\u001b[110Git\u001b[113Gon.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBidding:\u001b[22m a job with the switch on and n\u001b[45G con\u001b[50Gract \u001b[56Girst looks at the open tend\u001b[85Gs.\u001b[88GIt skips\u001b[97Gtenders whose\u001b[111Ggoods its\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhol\u001b[9G can't tak\u001b[20G and\u001b[25Gones\u001b[30Gits\u001b[34Gcompany\u001b[42Galready\u001b[50Gbid\u001b[54Gon.\u001b[58GIt\u001b[61Gprices\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Ggoods\u001b[78Gat\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gcheapest\u001b[94Gsource\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gits\u001b[108Gowner's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmarket\u001b[12Grep\u001b[16Grts and adds\u001b[29Gthe trip's charges and\u001b[52Ga profit. It\u001b[65Gbids\u001b[70Gonly\u001b[75Gwithin\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gtender's\u001b[95Gbudget\u001b[102Gand\u001b[106Gonly\u001b[111Gif\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcompany can pay for the\u001b[29Gg\u001b[31Gods a\u001b[37Gd th\u001b[42G bond. Among th\u001b[58G tenders\u001b[67Git \u001b[71Gan bid on,\u001b[82Git picks th\u001b[94G \u001b[96Gn\u001b[99Gwith the most budget\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleft\u001b[10Gover.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mThe profit:\u001b[17G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[21Gjob's\u001b[27Gtarget\u001b[34Gprofit,\u001b[42Gor\u001b[45Gone\u001b[49Gcredit\u001b[56Gmore\u001b[61Gthan\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gbest\u001b[75Gordinary\u001b[84Gtrade\u001b[90Git\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gmake,\u001b[105Gwhichever\u001b[115Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ghigher. This was my re\u001b[28Gd\u001b[30Gng\u001b[33Gof the plan's\u001b[47G\"above the best trade's\u001b[71Gestimate\".\u001b[