[0.213, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 16 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msince per hour the policies hop between the stations of Ore's one orbit.                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 17 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe planning documents' home-region allocation (scope, the roadmap's region supply and D-076) waits    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 18 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor W13 to restate it as founding.                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  5 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mW12 is done: [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mcompetitive procurement\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#tender-contract-w11-2026-11-21), on     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  6 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-101\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decision-ledger.md#d-101), with no engine edit; its six slices, the governance fixture         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  7 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`fixture_governance`) last, and what is left are in the plan. W13, the multi-region governance        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  8 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mscenario, is next. The planning documents' home-region allocation (scope, the roadmap's region supply  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  9 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand D-076) waits for W13 to restate it as founding. W22, the drives past the torch, waits for the first\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 10 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mlarger hull. Jettison's station traffic lanes were measured and parked (`fixture_traffic`,             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 11 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m2026-11-22), to be taken up when it fails. The SDK is pinned to `14fc23a`. A commit is gated in the    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 12 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msecond checkout, `build/gate-tree`, with `--tidy`, editing alone beside it                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 13 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mgating beside the work\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](build-and-gates.md#gating-beside-the-work)). A ship steered in a station's   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 14 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mframe still runs every step, which is most of the zero-client run's steps, more so since per hour the  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 15 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mpolicies hop between the stations of Ore's one orbit.                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 16 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m What\u001b[16Geach\u001b[21Gtask\u001b[26Gfound\u001b[32Gand\u001b[36Gleft,\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Ghow\u001b[50Geach\u001b[55Gwas\u001b[59Gclosed,\u001b[67Gis\u001b[70Gin\u001b[73G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mhistory\u001b[39m](history.md),\u001b[96Gnewest\u001b[103Gfirst.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BRunn\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell com\u001b[25Gd…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m$ cd '/home/ivan/project\u001b[31G/manifest' && git \u001b[50Giff --stat\r\u001b[14C\u001b[2B12m 21s ·\u001b[25G↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m38.2k \u001b[34Goken\u001b[39G)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
